	(text "SHEET 09 - CONNECTORS / DEBUG (PLAN.md sec.7)\nAmp module control per PLAN.md amp-module requirement (EN + FAULT + OTW):\n  J901 -> TPA3221 stereo module (EN default-off via R901; FAULT/OTW are open-drain, pulled to 3V3_AON).\n  J902 -> TPA3221 PBTL subwoofer module. Amp POWER comes from J103/J104 on sheet 01 (SYSTEM_BAT+).\nDebug: CM4 console UART (GPIO14/15), RP2040 console UART (GPIO0/1), RP2040 SWD on sheet 01 (J106).\nExpansion: CM4 SPI0 + 8 spare CM4 GPIOs + CM4 I2C. All 3V3 logic. Test points on every major rail."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 30 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3b334fc5-9874-5729-afd0-1ee6845ca071")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
